# The Supabase CLI's local scratch directory. Machine-specific by nature — it
# caches the CLI version, the linked project, the pooler URL and the versions of
# the services that project is currently running.
#
# Committing it is actively harmful once more than one machine is in play: two
# developers on two CLI versions produce two different `cli-latest` files and a
# merge conflict over a cache nobody reads. This is the ignore file `supabase
# init` normally writes; it was missing here, and the directory had started to
# be tracked as a result.
.temp
.branches
.env
